<p><a id=3D"_edn2" title=3D"" href=3D"#_ednref2" name=3D"_edn2">[2 ]</a> =
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Present rise in temperature is caused by a=
n increase of CO2 from 270 ppm to 385 ppm since 1780. Including methane a=
